Let us trace Dijkstra's algorithm finding the shortest path from Node 0 to Node 2 in this weighted graph:
*   Edge $0 \to 1$ (weight 4)
*   Edge $0 \to 2$ (weight 9)
*   Edge $1 \to 2$ (weight 3)

